 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Anstatt",
   "texto": [
    "**Anstatt** + infinitive with **zu** means «for»: **Anstatt zu reisen, lese ich Bücher** (instead of traveling, I read books). It's more formal than «statt … zu».",
    "If the subject changes, **anstatt dass** is used with full prayer: **Anstatt dass wir reisen, bleiben wir zu Hause** (instead of traveling, we stay at home)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "um-zu in history texts",
   "texto": [
    "**Um … zu** expresses purpose with the same subject: **Die Römer bauten Straßen, um Städte zu verbinden** (the Romans built roads to join cities). With another subject is used «damit»."
   ]
